# i18n UTF-8 Safety Rule

- Never update `src/i18n/locales/*.json` using shell bulk replace commands.
- Prefer structured edits (`ApplyPatch`/editor-level changes) for locale files.
- Keep locale files in UTF-8 and preserve accents exactly.
- When adding or updating keys, touch all required languages in the same change.

## Required validation after locale edits

